    "http://schema.org/caption": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "A white structure stands in the middle of a black stage. It has ladders as it's legs and a plank across the top. There are long white sticks and feathers sticking out the top. Two dance artists interact with the structure - one hanging from the plank with one leg on the ground and the other lying on the top of the plank with legs in the air. Both dance artists are wearing white and have stilts on."
      }
    ]
