    "http://schema.org/caption": [
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Photo collage: the top image is Six dancers in a bright studio. They are all wearing rehearsal clothing and are facing towards the mirror, slightly away from the camera. They have their right arms up in the air and their knees slightly bent. Their body's are slightly arched in a exuberant fashion. Under this is a collage of four Zoom screens of people dancing in living rooms. They have their right arms reaching upwards. Their left arms are down across their stomachs."
      }
    ]
